A read-aloud button on an answer where the runtime speaks (a speech
adapter is given): upstream's thread has the primitives (Speak,
StopSpeaking) but no button. UNIT-45.

--- a/src/upstream/components/assistant-ui/elements/thread.aui.tsx
+++ b/src/upstream/components/assistant-ui/elements/thread.aui.tsx
@@ -64,6 +64,7 @@ import {
